<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia buys 28,000 tonnes white sugar - trade.</title>
<headline>Tunisia buys 28,000 tonnes white sugar - trade.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia bought two cargoes of 14,000 tonnes each of white sugar for May and July delivery at a snap tender on Wednesday, traders said.</p>
<p>The price was not disclosed.</p>
<p>Tunisia on Monday bought 14,000 tonnes of white sugar at $366 C&amp;F per tonne for April delivery.</p>
<p>--Tunis newsroom, 2161-787538</p>
